
  Horcrux (Gentoo-based live / installer)
  ----------------------------------------
  Install to disk : horcrux-installer          (interactive)
                    horcrux-installer -a -d /dev/DISK   (automatic, ERASES the disk)
  Web UI / API    : https://<this-ip>:8006     user: admin
                    password: cat /var/lib/horcrux/initial-admin-password
  Console login   : root / horcrux  (change it!)
  Wi-Fi           : iwctl   (then: station wlan0 connect <ssid>)

